# Generated AWS CLI artifacts. Task-definition dumps and service/register
# responses carry every env var IN PLAINTEXT, including credentials.
# Four such files sat untracked here on 2026-09-18 with 12 plaintext secrets
# each, one `git add .` away from entering history. Never commit these.
*taskdef*.json
*-taskdef.json
*-output.json
